Get comments and discussions from a Notion page.

Returns discussions with full comment content in XML format. By default, returns page-level discussions only. On supported Business connections, pending suggested edits use `kind="suggested_edit"` and their `discussion://` URL can be passed to `get_suggested_edit`. Resolved suggestions stay retired. Check `suggested_edits_status` to distinguish an empty result from unavailable suggestion discovery.

Tip: Use the `fetch` tool with `include_discussions: true` first to see where discussions are anchored in the page content, then use this tool to retrieve full discussion threads. The `discussion://` URLs in the fetch output match the discussion IDs returned here.

